<title>BELGIUM: Ostend air freight up 7.1 percent in Sept.</title>
<headline>Ostend air freight up 7.1 percent in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ostend handled 5,741 tonnes of air cargo traffic last month, an increase of 7.1 percent on September 1995, airport figures show.</p>
<p>The major airfreight market from Ostend is in cigarettes for the Commonwealth of Independent States (CIS).</p>
<p>In the first nine months of 1996, the Belgian airport handled 64,834 tonnes of air cargo, up 20.1 percent on the same period in 1995. - Air Cargo Newsroom tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
</text>
